    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a standard-6 (150 µm) nozzle along a 5990 µm G-code path at 45.02 mm/min, filling an 8665 µm footprint at 558 µm line pitch; report fill lines, filament mass, print time, and deposition rate.",
    "rationale": "Bioprinting fill/hatch plan. Fill lines = ceil(footprint/pitch) = ceil(8665/558) = 16 lines. Extrusion volume per path = π(d/2)²·L = π(75)²·5990 µm³ = 105.85 nL. Print time = L/v = 5990 µm / 45.02 mm/min = 7.98 s. Filament mass = volume × density (1.012 g/cm³) = 107.12 µg. Deposition rate = volume/time = 795.6 nL/min. Ink density assumed uniform; nozzle treated as circular bore.",
